    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Man Lacking in Common Sense",
      "",
      "A man went to hang out at his friend’s house.",
      "In the evening, when the man was about to go home, it suddenly started to rain heavily.",
      "His friend offered for him to stay the night, and the man agreed.",
      "",
      "The friend went to prepare things for the night’s sleep. After he was done, he realized that the man was gone.",
      "The friend took out his cell phone to call the man, but despite trying for a long time, he was unable to get through.",
      "Having failed to contact the man, the friend had no other choice but to sit on the couch and wait.",
      "",
      "After a long time, the man finally came back.",
      "His shirt and pants were all wet; the rain had left him soaked to the skin.",
      "",
      "His friend was shocked and asked, “Where have you been?”",
      "",
      "The man, out of breath, said, ..",
      ".. “I… I went home to get my pajamas. It was raining so heavily, even my phone got wet”."
    ]
